+This record supersedes the draft build and packaging statuses above. The complete preceding source note is retained unchanged. The product and actual build source is commit `5c789f501b5cc82187976a1e916d239e0710415a` (9,588 tracked files). Documentation revisions after that commit do not constitute another product build. The project source ZIP contains that exact committed tree. The historical upstream basis is OpenAI Codex 0.167.0, commit `086ccc833bc9cf01024ad2dd6af7dbd421b6bf9a`; this is provenance, not official CLI compatibility support.
