+Actual final-binary checks passed: three version commands, three help commands and six isolated startup cases with enabled/malformed legacy logging settings. The full package contains 553 files; every ZIP entry was read back and matched to the package. All runtime files and platform helpers match the previously tested base package; only the source-offer and package-receipt metadata were extended.
